HB0272 Investment in Wyoming housing.
Sponsored By: Representative(s) Sherwood, Harshman and Thayer and
Senator(s) Brennan and Gierau
AN ACT relating to community development; creating the Wyoming housing
investment program; providing legislative findings; providing for grants and
loans for housing projects; specifying terms and conditions for grants and
loans; creating an account; providing for an annual transfer of funds; requiring
reports; making conforming amendments; providing a sunset date for the program;
and providing for an effective date.
1/21/2025 Bill Number Assigned
1/22/2025 H Received for Introduction
2/3/2025 H Did not Consider for Introduction